type: software
title: "ACPU-1 Tempest: an atmospheric calculation processor unit for ensemble chaotic computation"
abstract: >-
  Design study of a domain-specific processor for ensemble numerical weather
  prediction, atmospheric data assimilation and dispersion: architecture,
  pre-silicon performance/energy evaluation, 3 nm process integration,
  packaging, and a cross-platform software stack.
